[stdout] Release Notes:
[stdout] ### New features and improvements
[stdout] - Add show/hide matching filter control to UI Task Scalars and Plots ([ClearML #744](https://github.com/clearml/clearml/issues/744), [ClearML #1253](https://github.com/clearml/clearml/issues/1253))
[stdout] - Task Comparison view: Display task color indicators in task list instead of task legend ([ClearML #1461](https://github.com/clearml/clearml/issues/1461))
[stdout] - Add support for setting task type during UI task creation ([ClearML Web #115](https://github.com/clearml/clearml-web/issues/115))
[stdout] - Add configuration-based overrides for default Elasticsearch mappings
[stdout] - Add UI task clone options to reset Python requirements
[stdout] - Update Elastic to version 8.19.9
[stdout] - Make Task Repository URL in Task Execution tab clickable
[stdout] - Support short project names (fewer than 3 characters)
[stdout] 
[stdout] ### Bug Fixes
[stdout] - Fix API Server sometimes crashes on sharded Redis deployments ([ClearML Server #305](https://github.com/clearml/clearml-server/issues/305))
[stdout] - Fix UI bulk task reset affecting published tasks ([ClearML #1490](https://github.com/clearml/clearml/issues/1490))
[stdout] - UI Object table filters:
[stdout]   * Fix "User" filter in UI "All Models" table not displaying users who have no tasks
[stdout]   * Fix "User" filter displaying outdated user names after name change
[stdout] - Fix tasks not appearing in the correct queue after being moved in UI Orchestration > Queues
[stdout] - Fix UI Task Scalars tab hiding multiple graphs with the same name when toggling one
[stdout] - Fix Scientific notation can't be used in integer/float fields in UI Pipeline "New Run" modal
[stdout] - Fix "Enqueue" button is enabled in UI Task "Enqueue" / " Retry" modal when "Queue" field is blank
[stdout] - Global search
[stdout]   * Fix filter section not displaying by default when switching from Advanced to Basic search modes
[stdout]   * Fix filter indicator appearing on all search tabs instead of the active tab
[stdout]   * Fix spaces being removed while typing in search term
[stdout] - Fix Project Path icon displayed on Root Project folder in UI Reports page
[stdout] - Fix last graph legends in UI task table comparison view are obscured
[stdout] - Fix project tag filters displaying task tags in UI Projects
[stdout] - Fix sorting not working in UI task comparison selection
[stdout] - Fix missing "Edit" button in task Configuration tab
[stdout] - Fix UI comparison plots incorrectly merging subplots with multiple variants
[stdout] - Fix “No data to show” message incorrectly appearing while UI pages load
[stdout] - Fix Projects Workload graph's tooltip does not display all legends
